---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-row">
    <p>© {year} <a href="/">4mple Lab</a></p>
    <nav aria-label="外部リンク"><a class="icon-button" href="https://github.com/4mplelab" aria-label="4mple LabのGitHub" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .8a11.2 11.2 0 0 0-3.54 21.83c.56.1.77-.24.77-.54v-2.1c-3.12.68-3.78-1.33-3.78-1.33-.51-1.3-1.25-1.65-1.25-1.65-1.02-.7.08-.69.08-.69 1.13.08 1.73 1.16 1.73 1.16 1 1.72 2.63 1.22 3.27.93.1-.73.39-1.22.71-1.5-2.49-.28-5.1-1.25-5.1-5.54 0-1.22.44-2.22 1.15-3-.12-.28-.5-1.42.11-2.96 0 0 .94-.3 3.08 1.15a10.7 10.7 0 0 1 5.6 0c2.14-1.45 3.08-1.15 3.08-1.15.61 1.54.23 2.68.11 2.96.72.78 1.15 1.78 1.15 3 0 4.3-2.62 5.26-5.12 5.54.4.35.76 1.03.76 2.08v3.1c0 .3.2.65.77.54A11.2 11.2 0 0 0 12 .8Z"/></svg></a><a class="icon-button" href="https://x.com/4mple_" aria-label="4mple LabのX" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18.9 2H22l-6.8 7.8L23.2 22H17l-4.9-7.4L5.6 22H2.4l8.3-9.5L.8 2h6.4l4.5 6.7L18.9 2Zm-1.1 18h1.7L6.2 3.9H4.4L17.8 20Z"/></svg></a></nav>
  </div>
  <p class="amazon-disclosure">Amazonのアソシエイトとして、当サイトは適格販売により収入を得ています。</p>
</footer>
<style>
  .site-footer { position:relative; display:block; width:100%; box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; background:var(--canvas); color:var(--muted); border-top:1px solid var(--frame-border); padding:24px; font-family:var(--site-font); font-size:11px; }
  .footer-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; }
  p { margin:0; line-height:1.8; }
  nav { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:16px; }
  .icon-button { display:grid; place-items:center; width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:6px; }
  .icon-button:hover { background:var(--soft); }
  .icon-button svg { width:18px; height:18px; }
  a { color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  a:hover { color:var(--text); }
  a:focus-visible { outline:2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:4px; }
  .amazon-disclosure { margin-top:12px; }
  @media (min-width:1024px) { .site-footer { z-index:calc(var(--sl-z-index-menu, 5) + 1); } }
  @media (max-width:799px) { .site-footer { padding:24px 16px; } }
</style>
